      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2795,
        "name": "秃秃豆",
        "desc": "<p>提瓦特常见的豆类作物。带有淡淡的香气，因食用方法多样而被各地民众广泛接受。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/26/88072335/1e67f272a1c27d4771c319ff7fc6cd3a_819004033186907061.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1547,
        "name": "薄荷",
        "desc": "饱含清凉成分的植物叶子。清爽冰凉的滋味能将暑气荡涤一空。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Mint_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2767,
        "name": "薄荷豆汤",
        "desc": "<p>用料简单的浓汤。薄荷与豆子下锅煮熟后打碎至顺滑，小火慢煮收稠出锅，最后缀以豆粒与薄荷叶。成品清新可口，热饮冷食两相宜。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/26/88072335/2abfd008d61dea1e8527de76458cfcb3_4056107661818130451.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2766,
        "name": "奇怪的薄荷豆汤",
        "desc": "<p>用料简单的浓汤。加入了过量的水导致汤汁变得很稀薄，比起菜肴更像是饮料。要不再加点冰块，改造成「薄荷豆水」吧...</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/26/88072335/67ccb6d10aa0209ea91d9199b65718e9_791800892490978306.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2765,
        "name": "美味的薄荷豆汤",
        "desc": "<p>用料简单的浓汤。浓厚的稠汤，带着淡淡的豆香迎面而来；丝滑的口感，夹杂有薄荷清爽的气息。味道朴实但不失可圈可点之处，让人仿佛在凉爽的树荫下漫步，享受着淳朴的快乐。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/26/88072335/cd6635fbd46b8781772f8d19361f208e_7933538099652337880.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "2★食物"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "绿汁脆球"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2742,
        "name": "食谱：绿汁脆球",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「绿汁脆球」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_3258818831949255353.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
