        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「脆饼珐提」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/16/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_1389585340137695578.png",
