        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「阿如拌饭」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/10/18/47826599/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_8393889243129779071.png",
